# Unrestricted egress to 0.0.0.0/0 — intentional; K8s nodes require full
# outbound internet access for image pulls, OS updates, and cluster traffic.
AVD-AWS-0104

# SSH ingress from 0.0.0.0/0 — intentional; cluster management requires SSH
# and access is gated by EC2 key-pair authentication.
AVD-AWS-0107

# Subnet map_public_ip_on_launch — intentional; instances need internet access
# during the provisioning window before their Elastic IP is associated.
AVD-AWS-0164
